<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Patch Validation Prompts</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section contains the full prompts for the patch validation policy described in Section <a href="#S3.SS2" title="3.2. Patch Validation Policy ‣ 3. Abstention and Validation Policies ‣ Abstain and Validate: A Dual-LLM Policy for Reducing Noise in Agentic Program Repair" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.2</span></a>.
Listing <a href="#LST3" title="Listing 3 ‣ Appendix C Patch Validation Prompts ‣ Abstain and Validate: A Dual-LLM Policy for Reducing Noise in Agentic Program Repair" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> shows the prompt for the specification generation step.</p>
</div>
<figure id="LST3" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float">Listing 3: </span>Using the original bug description and file contents to generate a specification.</figcaption>
