<div id="A3.SS3.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS3.p3.1" class="ltx_p">The specification generation step clearly outlines what the changes necessary should be and the review explanation shows that the agent patch adheres to that specification and so is judged to be correct.</p>
</div>
